<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-045" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-045-xietiao-daosheng" source-id="s-nanqishu-045-xietiao-daosheng-ws2273185">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-xietiao-daosheng:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">始安貞王<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-xietiao-daosheng:p001:m0004" ref="98q_mll_d6v">道生</persName>字孝伯，太祖次兄也。宋世爲奉朝請，卒。建元元年，追封謚。建武元年，追尊爲景皇，妃江氏爲后。立寢廟於御道西，陵曰脩安。生子<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-xietiao-daosheng:p001:m0066" ref="98q_mll_d6v_A">鳳</persName>、高宗、安陸昭王緬。</p>
</text>
